            "value": "Newhart, K. B., Holloway, R. W., Hering, A. S., & Cath, T. Y. (2019). Data-driven performance analyses of wastewater treatment plants: A review. Water Research, 157, 498-513. http://doi.org/10.1016/j.watres.2019.03.030 Y9\r\n",
